### How to load disks.
@load 'disks/some.disk'  # disks/ is the stdlib found in ./disks/
@load './this.disk'      # relative to wherever you ran bin/drive from (cwd)
@load 'that.disk'        # relative to wherever you ran bin/drive from (cwd)
@load 'and_this'         # no .disk extension required
###
